              {
                "block_type": "display-math",
                "text": "",
                "latex": "\\frac{d}{dt}u(t)=\\delta(t)",
                "image_slot_id": ""
              },
              {
                "block_type": "paragraph",
                "text": "So the correct choice is $\\delta(t)$. The other answers either keep the step itself, move the impulse away from the actual jump, or change the sign or scale.",
